sequenceDiagram
  participant S as Capteur IoT
  participant B as Broker MQTT
  participant MP as MqttEventPublisher
  participant D as Dashboard

  S->>S: onConnectionLost() → OFFLINE
  S->>MP: publish(ERROR, state=OFFLINE) → festival/device/{id}/status
  MP->>D: broadcast — updateDeviceState(OFFLINE)

  Note over S,B: Connexion MQTT perdue

  loop 3 messages perdus
    S->>B: publish() → timeout
    S->>S: retryCount++ — message mis en file d'attente
  end

  Note over S,B: Reconnexion établie

  S->>S: onReconnected() → IDLE
  S->>MP: publish(ERROR, state=IDLE, retryCount=3) → festival/device/{id}/status
  MP->>D: broadcast — updateDeviceState(IDLE)

  loop Messages en attente (x3)
    S->>MP: republier message → festival/venue/{id}/access
    MP->>D: broadcast via WebSocket
  end

  D->>D: "All pending messages republished"
